{% if part == "Vars" %}
{% endif %}
{% if part == "Doc" %}	DONE:
	- compared with the Laurent Martelli entries staging/openbook/laurent/cantaloupe_island.ly and cantaloupe_island_with_piano.ly (their melody file was never in this repository, their piano vamp is the same as the one in the Own version).
	- added the meta data from the Hal Leonard Real Jazz Book.
	- put in the tunes structure.
	- put in the chords (Hal Leonard Real Jazz Book).
	- put in the tune (Hal Leonard Real Jazz Book).
	- added youtube performances.
	- converted the Own version (a lead sheet with a piano arrangement: comping
		chords and bass line, typeset by Michael Dienert <mdienert@t-online.de>)
		from the old mako draft staging/openbook/cantaloupe_island.ly.mako.
