	- check the chords (Hal Leonard Real Jazz Book).
	- check the tune (Hal Leonard Real Jazz Book).
	- hear the tune to check that it is right and adjust the tempo.
	- the book spells the title "Cantelope Island".
	- add the piano vamp from the original recording (the Own version has
